  "body": "Contact: +44 7462 912 867\n\n                [REDACTED_EMAIL]\n\nGET A QUOTE\nLog In\n\nHOME\n\nSERVICES\n\nPROJECTS\n\nFABRICS\n\nSHOP\n\nCONTACT\n\nBLOG\n\nDiscover our bespoke\n\nUpholstery \n\nView more\nGET A QUOTE\nWelcome\nto Miracle Couch UK\n\nMira brings over 25 years of hands-on experience in upholstery and furniture restoration, delivering trusted craftsmanship to clients across London. Through Miracle Couch UK, that expertise is reflected in every project, offering a professional and personal service built on quality, reliability and close attention to detail.\n\n \n\nWe provide a wide range of specialist services including upholstery, reupholstery, headboard upholstery, loose covers, leather upholstery, foam replacement and fillings, as well as commercial upholstery for businesses and interior spaces. Every project is approached with precision and care, using quality materials and skilled techniques to achieve elegant, lasting results.\n\n \n\nServing homes, businesses and design projects throughout London, our aim is to deliver refined finishes tailored to each client’s requirements. Whether refreshing interiors, restoring existing furniture or creating bespoke upholstered pieces, Miracle Couch UK offers dependable workmanship backed by decades of genuine industry experience.\n\nDiscover our Craft\nServices\nReupholstery\n\nWith over 25 years of expertise, we don’t just deliver a reupholstered piece we deliver craftsmanship, attention to detail, inspired design, and a fresh vision, all with the goal of elevating your furniture with a swift turnaround time.\n\nView More\nCushions & Accessories\n\nCrafted with love and a focus on quality, Mira’s collection showcases a wide range of beautiful designer fabrics and bespoke furniture pieces designed to elevate any space. With a big range of colours and sizes everyone can find what they need. \n\nView More\nLoose Covers \n\nOur loose covers are crafted to look just like fixed upholstery. Mira’s loose covers are unlike any other, tailored to fit perfectly and hug every curve of your furniture, giving it a brand-new look while protecting both the original fabric or hide any pre-existing imperfections.\n\nView More\nCommercial Upholstery \n\nWe specialise in commercial upholstery that enhances the look, comfort, and durability of your business space. From seating to bespoke installations, our work is built to handle daily use while maintaining a polished, high-quality finish. \n\nView More\n25+ Years of Expert Upholstery: Meet the Family Behind Miracle Couch UK\n\n \n\nA Foundation of Real-World Expertise\n\nWith over 25 years of experience, Mira’s mastery of upholstery wasn't built overnight. It was earned through decades of technical work in the furniture industry. Before founding Miracle Couch UK, Mira spent 22 years working at the highest level of furniture manufacturing, where she developed a deep understanding of structural engineering, frame integrity, and fabric durability.\n\nWhen she moved to the UK, she spent five years refining her skills in",
